    {
      "type": "NarrativeText",
      "text": "regulatory standards. Performed reference data management and static data enrichment, resolving data quality issues and ensuring accuracy across downstream trading and risk systems. Conducted daily market price validation and exception management, investigating pricing discrepancies and ensuring accurate valuation data across asset classes. Managed corporate actions lifecycle for Equities and Derivatives, including symbol changes, stock splits, mergers, instrument ID updates, and strike price adjustments. Supported regulatory reporting initiatives for MiFID II and EMIR by maintaining accurate security reference data and ensuring compliance with reporting requirements. Played a key role in the EUREX NEXTGEN migration, successfully supporting trade rebooking, product onboarding, and implementation of daily and weekly expiry instruments with no downstream impact.",
